File Index

/_BorderedPanel.scss
Purpose: Shared `borderedPanelTitle` mixin — a bordered panel with its title embedded in the top border line (classic box-drawing TUI look). Used by the compact HUD's terminal panel (styles/hud/CompactLayoutShell.module.scss). The title's background is `var(--sa-panel-bg, $bg-color)` so a theme setting `--sa-panel-bg` (see styles/hud/themes/slateAmber.theme.scss) repaints it in sync with the panel's own background without the caller duplicating the color.

/hud/
Purpose: CSS modules for the compact HUD layout's React components (apps/game-client/src/components/hud/) — see styles/hud/.annotated for the per-file index.

/AccountModal.module.scss
Purpose: Phase D — AccountModal.tsx's CSS module. Visual language mirrors ConnectModal.module.scss (backdrop/modal/header/closeButton, primary/secondaryButton) at AudioSettingsModal's narrower single-column width; adds statusOk/statusErr lines for save/load feedback.

/LibraryModal.module.scss
Purpose: LibraryModal.tsx's CSS module (tabs, list/editor split, tree grouping, scribe panel). Phase E added tagRow/tagInput (the new tag field), bodyStats/bodyStatsWarn/bodyStatsOver (line/char-limit warning text), and treeSubGroupHeader (nested tag sub-groups within a spool group on the Notes tab) — reused the existing treeGroup/treeGroupHeader classes for parchment/books tag headers rather than adding parallel ones.
